---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Support">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Support</h1>

  <div
    class="prose prose-neutral mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-headings:font-semibold"
  >
    <p>
      Running into a bug, have a feature request, or just have a question
      about Fexer? Reach out and I'll get back to you.
    </p>

    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p>
      <a href="mailto:nandanvarma.me@gmail.com">nandanvarma.me@gmail.com</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Before you write in</h2>
    <p>
      A few things that help me help you faster:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>What iPhone model and iOS version you're on</li>
      <li>What shooting mode or setting you were using</li>
      <li>Steps to reproduce the issue, if it's a bug</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Layout>
